Dialogue: {
	EpilogueHaku5: Haku: It's snowing... just like that day. Master Zabuza, this time... I will stay with you.
	EpilogueZabuza1: Zabuza: ...Haku.
	EpilogueZabuza2: Zabuza: You fool... right to the end, you took the blow for me.
	EpilogueZabuza3: Zabuza: I always called you a tool... but, Haku...
	EpilogueZabuza4: Zabuza: At least... let me lie beside you.
	EpilogueZabuza5: Zabuza: If I could... I would go where you are going...
	EpilogueHaku1: Haku: Master Zabuza... I'm sorry. I could not be your blade.
	EpilogueHaku2: Haku: That day, you found me in the snow...
	EpilogueHaku3: Haku: Being your tool... made me happy.
	EpilogueSnow: It has begun to snow. In the village where Haku was born, it snows all year round.
	EpilogueRest: The demon and his boy sleep together in the snow.
	HakuForestRecall: Haku: ...We met in the forest, didn't we? What a pity.
	LakeZabuza1: Zabuza: Escorting the old bridge builder... Bad luck, Leaf.
	LakeKakashi1: Kakashi: Stay back. ...The Demon of the Mist, Zabuza Momochi.
	LakeZabuza2: Zabuza: Water Prison Jutsu!
	LakeKakashi2: Kakashi: This prison can't be broken from inside! Forget me—
	LakeZabuza3: Zabuza: Water Clone Jutsu.
	LakeGoal: Break the water prison and free Kakashi!
	LakeKakashi3: Kakashi: ...Well done. I'll take it from here.
	LakeZabuza4: Zabuza: What—
	LakeHaku: Hunter-nin: Thank you. I have been tracking this man... I will deal with him.
	LakeKakashi4: Kakashi: ...Hunter-nin dispose of the body on the spot. With senbon? He's still alive.
	LakeKakashi5: Kakashi: The Mist ninja will head for the broken bridge. Back to Tazuna, and get ready.
	LakeRetreat: Zabuza: ...Hmph.
	LakeRetreatEnd: Zabuza collapses into water and is gone in the mist. The prison breaks apart.
	DemonBrothersWarn: A chain drags across the ground somewhere in the mist... someone is closing in from both sides!
	DemonBrothersDown: The Demon Brothers are down. The Mist chunin were after Tazuna, not you. Go back to his hut and ask him why.
	Whisper1: ???: ...You again.
	Whisper2: ???: Stay away from this bridge.
	Whisper3: (From the mist comes the scrape of a blade dragged over stone.)
	Whisper4: ???: The mist swallows everything... you too.
	SenbonWarning: ???: One more step and you die.
	PreviewZabuza1: ???: ...You again, Leaf brat.
	PreviewZabuza2: ???: I was careless last time. This bridge will never be finished.
	PreviewHaku: ???: ...Your wounds have not healed. It is not yet time. Let us go.
	PreviewEnd: The figures in the mist are gone... the Mist ninja are watching this bridge.
	BridgeOpening: Zabuza: Let's settle this here, on this bridge.
	HakuArrive: Haku: Master Zabuza, leave this to me.
	ZabuzaFrenzy: Zabuza: ...Haku. You were a fool to the very end.
	HakuFrenzy: Haku: The reason I exist is gone... then let everything freeze.
	CageTrapped: "{0} was trapped by the ice mirrors"
}

